# generate_app_icon.py's outputs are DERIVED and regenerated at build time (the builder runs the
# generator), so none of them is committed. Names follow --name/--out: <stem>_master.png,
# <stem>_preview_64.png and any --sizes.
*_master.png
*_preview_64.png
*_64.png
*_128.png
_*_rendered.png
*.icns
_cdp_launcher_backup/
*.iconset/
